{"name":"Sentinel","hex":"#d2e0d6","fetched":"2026-10-13","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"Sentinel","whole":true,"parts":[{"part":"Proper noun","definitions":["A place in the United States:\nAn unincorporated community in Maricopa County, Arizona.\nA ghost town in Fresno County, California.\nAn unincorporated community in Polk County, Missouri.\nA town in Washita County, Oklahoma.","An unincorporated community in Maricopa County, Arizona."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/Sentinel"}],"entries":[{"title":"Mount Sentinel","blocks":[{"text":"Mount Sentinel, originally known as \"Mount Woody,\" is a small mountain located immediately east of the University of Montana in Missoula, Montana. At a height of 1,958 feet and an elevation of 5,158 feet (1,572 m), Mount Sentinel also features the hillside letter \"M\", a large concrete structure 620 feet (189 m) up its western face."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/b/b2/Umt-mt-sentinel.jpg/330px-Umt-mt-sentinel.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Mount_Sentinel","wikidata":"Q6923559"},{"title":"Sentinel Dome","blocks":[{"text":"Sentinel Dome is a granite dome in Yosemite National Park, United States. It lies on the south wall of Yosemite Valley, 0.8 miles (1.3 km) southwest of Glacier Point and 1.4 miles (2.3 km) northeast of Profile Cliff."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/7/76/Sentinel_Dome%2C_Yosemite_NP.jpg/330px-Sentinel_Dome%2C_Yosemite_NP.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sentinel_Dome","wikidata":"Q4416374"},{"title":"Sentinel (comics)","blocks":[{"text":"The Sentinels are a group of mutant-hunting robots appearing in American comic books published by Marvel Comics. They first appeared in The X-Men #14, written by Stan Lee and illustrated by Jack Kirby. The original Sentinels were created by Bolivar Trask, and they are typically depicted as antagonists to the X-Men."}],"image":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/9/92/Sentinels_%28Marvel_Annotated_2%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sentinel_(comics)","wikidata":"Q782181"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/1/1e/Glacial_lake_missoula.jpg/500px-Glacial_lake_missoula.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/1/1e/Glacial_lake_missoula.jpg/500px-Glacial_lake_missoula.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"Glacial Lake Missoula","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AGlacial_lake_missoula.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/9/98/Balsamroot.jpg/500px-Balsamroot.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/9/98/Balsamroot.jpg/500px-Balsamroot.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"arrowleaf balsamroot","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3ABalsamroot.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/9/93/Sentinel_Dome_Panorama.jpg/500px-Sentinel_Dome_Panorama.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/9/93/Sentinel_Dome_Panorama.jpg/1280px-Sentinel_Dome_Panorama.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/9/93/Sentinel_Dome_Panorama.jpg/500px-Sentinel_Dome_Panorama.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3ASentinel_Dome_Panorama.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb